        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "After looking through various hw/sw use cases and writing on debugging including stepping as technique (https://matu3ba.github.io/articles/optimal_debugging/#practice), so far I hold the opinion that [RAD Debugger](https://github.com/EpicGamesExt/raddebugger) is the closest towards a hackable/modifiable debugger (library framework), but does not attempt to solve performance bottlenecks of tracing + remote debugging use cases (yet).",
